WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/telemetry/components/SignalCompareControls.tsx — a PURELY CONTROLLED compare-controls leaf
  (prompt data sources: useTranslation only; shared components: @/components/ui + @/components/motion; charts/maps:
  none). It fetches nothing — its parent (SignalDiffPage / SignalsWorkspacePage) owns atA/atB/search/category and
  merges the onChange* callbacks. Composition (FadeIn > GlassPanel "p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-4"):
    topSlot     : optional slot above the windows (vehicle picker, etc.)
    windows     : grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 — Window A (cyan label + HelpTooltip help.signal.snapshot) and
                  Window B (amber label + HelpTooltip help.signal.diff), each an <Input type="datetime-local">
    presets     : "Quick presets:" + DIFF_PRESETS.map(<Button variant=secondary size=sm>) → applyPreset writes
                  BOTH windows via toLocalDatetimeInput(compute())
    filter row  : border-top — <Input type="search" "Filter signals…"> + CATEGORY_PREFIXES.map(toggle chip;
                  active = blue ring) + a ghost "Clear" button when a category is set
  EXPORTED from the module (the pages drive their server-side filter strings with these → ported VERBATIM + tested):
    CATEGORY_PREFIXES (8 ids + case-insensitive `matches` regexes), DIFF_PRESETS (5 ids + `compute` offsets),
    toLocalDatetimeInput(date) → "yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm" local, isoOrEmpty(local) → UTC ISO (Date.toISOString) or "".
  Extracted i18n keys: signalDiff.{windowA, windowB, presetsLabel, filterPlaceholder, clearCategory};
    signalDiff.cat.{battery, drive, climate, security, motor, tire, media, safety};
    signalDiff.preset.{nowVs1h, nowVs1d, beforeAfterCharge, lastDrive, todayVsYesterday};
    help.signal.snapshot (+ .aria), help.signal.diff (+ .aria).

